||=========================================Trees========================================||

1. In Trees we mostly use BFS.
2. DFS is also used but it depends on the situation.
3. BFS is done using queues and a while loop.
4. we sometimes use a for loop inside a while loop.
5. This is because we want to make changes in a particular level.
6. if we don't require a level by action then there is no need for a for-loop.